{
  "wireMagic": "pb3",
  "pens": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wsWinStyles": [ {
  
  } ],
  "wpWinPositions": [ {
  
  } ],
  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 11890,
    "dDurationMs": 7170,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "In 1970, amidst rising concerns for the health\nof our ocean, coasts, and inland communities,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 19060,
    "dDurationMs": 5920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the National Oceanic and Atmospheric Administration\nwas created. Among NOAA’s new responsibilities"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 24980,
    "dDurationMs": 5680,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "was the development of comprehensive programs\nto protect our ocean, coasts, their ecosystems"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30660,
    "dDurationMs": 5850,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and the communities that rely on them. Essential\nstewardship initiatives arose from these programs,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 36510,
    "dDurationMs": 5660,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "including protection of our nation’s fisheries\nand marine mammal populations, restoring ecosystems"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 42170,
    "dDurationMs": 5659,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "impacted by oil and chemical spills, and a\nworld-class weather service protecting life"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 47829,
    "dDurationMs": 2541,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and property."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50370,
    "dDurationMs": 5959,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Over the last 50 years, NOAA’s stewardship\nefforts have greatly expanded. NOAA scientists"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56329,
    "dDurationMs": 6030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "monitor and document the many ways our world\nis changing around us. We face unprecedented"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62359,
    "dDurationMs": 5361,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "challenges, and NOAA remains at the forefront\nof addressing them. Through a national marine"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 67720,
    "dDurationMs": 6530,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "debris program, citizen science and education\nprograms, and many others, NOAA is actively"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 74250,
    "dDurationMs": 4810,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "engaging the public and meeting the challenges\naffecting our ecosystems and the communities"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 79060,
    "dDurationMs": 2540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that depend on them."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 81600,
    "dDurationMs": 5540,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "From monitoring and protecting freshwater,\nmarine, and coastal ecosystems, including coral"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 87140,
    "dDurationMs": 5030,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "reefs and estuaries, to conserving and restoring\nthem for the public to enjoy and benefit from"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92170,
    "dDurationMs": 5140,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "for generations to come, stewardship IS the\nfoundation that NOAA will continue to build"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 97310,
    "dDurationMs": 3580,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "upon for our country’s future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 100890,
    "dDurationMs": 5220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We look forward to that future. To meet the\nchallenges of the next 50 years, NOAA must"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106110,
    "dDurationMs": 6890,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "ensure that our communities and ecosystems\nremain resilient. We’re embracing new technologies"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 113000,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and leveraging our nation’s greatest asset\n- our youth. We must prepare and inspire our"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118740,
    "dDurationMs": 5640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "leaders of tomorrow, and support the educators\nand community leaders who teach and nurture"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124380,
    "dDurationMs": 7550,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "imagination. Those of the next generation\nare the leaders of stewardship for the future."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131930,
    "dDurationMs": 5720,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "The success of NOAA’s stewardship initiatives\ndemands that we embrace our country’s diversity."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 137650,
    "dDurationMs": 5740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "We must reflect, understand, and respond to\nthe broad range of communities, partners,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 143390,
    "dDurationMs": 6050,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and stakeholders we serve. Together, we’ll\nmaintain healthy ecosystems, communities,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 149440,
    "dDurationMs": 2639,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "and economies that are resilient in the face\nof change."
    } ]
  } ]
}
